/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (While India has a substantial pig population, the industry is often characterized by its challenges rather than its successes. The industry's growth has raised critical questions about its sustainability and ethical implications, especially regarding animal welfare and its detrimental environmental impact.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
