216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Waste Management & Public Health Compromise: Proper waste management is critical for both environmental protection and animal welfare. Most piggery units lack adequate infrastructure for managing solid and liquid waste. Wastewater is often discharged into drains or fields untreated, causing soil and water degradation and pollution. Unmitigated waste breeds diseases that can affect public health.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
