/S /P
/E (Field findings from 146 units across the country and scientific literature reviewed in this paper point to an industry largely defined by unregulated operations, where poor infrastructure and an absence of technical oversight create conditions for environmental degradation and potential public health hazard. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Addressing these risks requires more than incremental change. A robust, multi-stakeholder response, grounded in statutory obligations, is urgently needed. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
